					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Don't be. I didn't mean that as any kind of criticism. Just a statement about a thing that I have observed. Your use of ellipses has never really pinged my radar as something my hyperactive grammar sense should be concerned with because you use them effectively. I just noticed that it was characteristic of you to use them.</p> <p>I still think counting up all the instances of said use is more weird than using them.</p> 
				 	]]>
