					<item>
				<guid>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-456140#post-1402508</guid>
				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-456140/work-journal-3#post-1402508</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Mon, 26 Mar 2012 14:00:33 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>mharbourgirl</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>569286</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I'm not sure which is weirder. The fact that Gears uses ellipses as a kind of personal signature (which isn't actually that weird, it could be much, much worse), or the fact that you counted them.</p> <p>Now, 42 ellipses would have been significant and a clear sign that he did it on purpose to make a bad joke. 43, well, that's just Gears from what I've observed. Not sure he's the odd one in this particular instance.</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
